WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.982
Lab 2 moves to a test subscription with
an Application Gateway WAF version

2
00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:09.437
two and its policy, as the guide's
pilot builds them, never production.

3
00:00:09.437 --> 00:00:14.050
Sign in to commercial Azure, write the
settings file, and run the check live,

4
00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:18.200
allowing the WAF policy queries
that aren't verified on Learn yet.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.592
Then compare with the guide's
Validate query: the mode,

6
00:00:21.592 --> 00:00:25.138
body inspection and rule sets
should match the kit's row.

7
00:00:25.138 --> 00:00:27.999
If a property is named
differently, record it.

8
00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:31.092
Nothing changed in Azure
and the plan wasn't run,

9
00:00:31.092 --> 00:00:33.312
so back out by deleting the output.

10
00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:38.200
The guide's own blocked-request test is
the application owner's, after the switch.

11
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.250
The authors haven't run this lab.
